<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-ALGERIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALGERIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Algerian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Monday, as reported by the official</p>
<p>Algerian news agency APS:</p>
<p> Utihad Mouloudia Alger   0    Utihad el Harrach	 1</p>
<p> Jeunesse Kabylie	   1    Mouloudia Club Alger    0</p>
<p> Sportif Constantine	0    Mouloudia Oran	    0</p>
<p> Widad Mostaganem	   1    Mouloudia Constantine   1</p>
<p> Chabab Batna		 1    Chabab Belouizdad	 1</p>
<p> Widad Tlemcen		1    Association Ain M'lila  0</p>
<p> Nadit Hussein Dey	  2    Widad Boufarik	    2</p>
<p> Utihad Ain Beida	   2    Utihad Chaouia	    1</p>
</text>
